[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[ (n+1)^2 - n^2 = 35 \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m Expanding and simplifying the left side, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[ n^2 + 2n + 1 - n^2 = 35 \]
