[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m To solve the problem, we first need to understand the difference between two consecutive perfect squares. The difference between the squares of two consecutive integers \( n \) and \( n+1 \) is given by:
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m (n+1)^2 - n^2 = (n^2 + 2n + 1) - n^2 = 2n + 1
