[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    x = \pm 3
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 2. **Determine the average of the solutions:**
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    The solutions to the equation are \( x = 3 \) and \( x = -3 \). The average of these solutions is:
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \text{Average} = \frac{3 + (-3)}{2} = \frac{0}{2} = 0
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m Therefore, the average of all the possible values of \( x \) is \(\boxed{0}\).<|endoftext|>
