[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    The shaded parts are the 1 square in the first iteration, plus the 9 squares in the second iteration, plus the 81 squares in the third iteration, plus the 729 squares in the fourth iteration, plus the 6561 squares in the fifth iteration:
