[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    1 + 9 + 81 + 729 + 6561 = 7660
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    Therefore, the fractional part of the shaded figure is:
