[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m Now, we find \( a \) and \( d \):
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m Recall \( (a, b) \) and \( (c, d) \) are points of intersection. So,
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m (a, b) = \left(0, 4\right) \quad \text{and} \quad (c, d) = \left(\frac{2}{3}, \frac{10}{9}\right)
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m Determine \( a \):
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m a = 0
