[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m Determine \( d \):
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m d = \frac{10}{9}
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m Finally, we calculate \( c - a \):
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[
