[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 5. **Evaluate the integral**:
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \int_{3}^{4} (-2 + 3\sqrt{1 - x^2}) \, dx
