[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m Thus, the correct answer is:
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \boxed{\sqrt{6}}
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \]
