[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m To find the midpoint of a line segment with endpoints \((x_1, y_1)\) and \((x_2, y_2)\), we use the midpoint formula:
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \left( \frac{x_1 + x_2}{2}, \frac{y_1 + y_2}{2} \right)
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m Given the endpoints \((2, 3)\) and \((8, 15)\), we can identify the endpoints as \((x_1, y_1) = (2, 3)\) and \((x_2, y_2) = (8, 15)\).
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m Now, substitute these values into the midpoint formula:
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \left( \frac{2 + 8}{2}, \frac{3 + 15}{2} \right)
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m Calculate the x-coordinate (midpoint x-coordinate):
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \frac{2 + 8}{2} = \frac{10}{2} = 5
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m Calculate the y-coordinate (midpoint y-coordinate):
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \frac{3 + 15}{2} = \frac{18}{2} = 9
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m So, the midpoint of the line segment is \((5, 9)\).
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m Next, we find the sum of the coordinates of the midpoint:
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 5 + 9 = 14
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m Therefore, the sum of the coordinates of the midpoint of the segment is \(\boxed{14}\).<|endoftext|>
