[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m     \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m     \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m     y = \frac{-112 \pm \sqrt{12544 + 12544}}{4}
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m     \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m     \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m     y = \frac{-112 \pm \sqrt{25088}}{4}
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m     \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m     \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m     y = \frac{-112 \pm 50\sqrt{29.66}}{4}
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m     \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m     \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m     y = -28 \pm 25\sqrt{29.66}
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m     \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 15. **Approximate \(\sqrt{29.66}\):**
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m     \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m     \sqrt{29.66} \approx 5.44
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m     \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 16. **Substitute back:**
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m     \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m     y = -28 \pm 25 \cdot 5.44 = -28 \pm 136
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m     \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 17. **This corresponds to two values of \(y\):**
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m     \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m     y = 108 \quad \text{or} \quad y = -106
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m     \]
