[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m     \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m     x^2 = 2(108)^2(28 - 108) = 2(11664)(-80) = -1956320
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m     \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m     For \(y = -106\):
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m     \[
