[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m As \( x \) approaches infinity, all terms involving \( \frac{1}{x} \) and \( \frac{1}{x^3} \) approach 0.
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
