[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \lim_{x \to \infty} \left( 3 - 0 + 0 \right) = 3
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m ### Step 3: Combine the Results
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m The numerator approaches 6 and the denominator approaches 3. Therefore, the horizontal asymptote is:
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m y = \frac{6}{3} = 2
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
