[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m To solve the expression \((4 \times 12) - (4 + 12)\), we will break it down into smaller steps and evaluate each part separately.
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m First, evaluate \(4 \times 12\):
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 4 \times 12 = 48
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m Next, evaluate \(4 + 12\):
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 4 + 12 = 16
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m Now, substitute these values back into the original expression:
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 48 - 16
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m Perform the subtraction:
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 48 - 16 = 32
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m Therefore, the value of \((4 \times 12) - (4 + 12)\) is \(\boxed{32}\).
