[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m I have eleven books, of which I want to bring two to read on vacation. How many different pairs can I choose?
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m To solve this problem, we need to determine the number of different ways to choose 2 books out of 11 to bring with us to a vacation. This involves using combinations, which calculate the number of ways to choose \( k \) items from a set of \( n \) items without regard to the order of selection. The formula for combinations is given by:
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \binom{n}{k} = \frac{n!}{k!(n-k)!}
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m Here, \( n = 11 \) and \( k = 2 \). Plugging in these values, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \binom{11}{2} = \frac{11!}{2!(11-2)!} = \frac{11!}{2! \cdot 9!}
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m To simplify the factorials, we can cancel out \( 9! \) in the numerator and the denominator:
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \binom{11}{2} = \frac{11 \times 10 \times 9!}{2! \times 9!} = \frac{11 \times 10}{2!} = \frac{11 \times 10}{2 \times 1} = \frac{110}{2} = 55
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m Therefore, the number of different pairs of books that can be chosen is:
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \boxed{55}
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m [Ground Truth]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 55
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m [Is Boxed Matched]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m True
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m [Extracted Answer]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 55
