[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m where $i$ and $k$ are generators. The group $ \bigl\langle\bigr[i,k\bigr]\bigr\rangle\bigl\{ \bigr[ib_{n-2},ab_{n-1}\bigr]\bigr\} $ is isomorphic to $SL_2$ but must be shown to be ab.
