[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 5. **Find the Intersection Points:**
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    - Solve the system of equations:
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m      y = -x + 1 \quad \text{and} \quad y = -x + 6
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m      \]
