[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m Robert reads 90 pages per hour. How many 270-page books can he read in six hours?
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m To determine how many 270-page books Robert can read in six hours, we need to follow these steps:
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 1. **Calculate Robert's reading speed in pages per hour:**
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    Robert reads 90 pages per hour.
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 2. **Determine the total number of pages Robert can read in six hours:**
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \text{Total pages} = \text{Reading speed} \times \text{Time}
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    Substituting the given values:
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \text{Total pages} = 90 \, \text{pages/hour} \times 6 \, \text{hours}
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \text{Total pages} = 540 \, \text{pages}
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 3. **Determine how many 270-page books can be read in 540 pages:**
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    We need to divide the total number of pages by the number of pages in one 270-page book.
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \text{Number of books} = \frac{\text{Total pages}}{\text{Pages per book}}
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    Substituting the values:
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \text{Number of books} = \frac{540 \, \text{pages}}{270 \, \text{pages/book}}
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \text{Number of books} = 2
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m Therefore, Robert can read \boxed{2} 270-page books in six hours.<|endoftext|>
