[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m Consider a robot that automatically moves on a grid of $n$ rows and $m$ columns (uniformly distributed). The robot can also pick up certain chips, represented by points in the plane, from two sorted stacks containing the following numbers. Its task is to reach a digit tile which contains a number.
