[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 4a^2b^2 = 9(a+b)^2
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m Expanding the right-hand side, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 4a^2b^2 = 9a^2 + 18ab + 9b^2
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m Rearranging terms, we obtain a quadratic equation in standard form:
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 9a^2 + 18ab + 9b^2 - 4a^2b^2 = 0
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m We can factor out \(b^2\) from the first two terms:
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 9a^2 + 9b^2 + 18ab - 4a^2b^2 = 0
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m We can use the identity \((a-b)^2 = a^2 - 2ab + b^2\) to rewrite the equation:
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 9(a^2 - 2ab + b^2) + 18ab - 4a^2b^2 = 0
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m Simplifying, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 9a^2 - 18ab + 9b^2 + 18ab - 4a^2b^2 = 0
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 9a^2 + 9b^2 = 4a^2b^2
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m Dividing through by 9:
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m a^2 + b^2 = \frac{4a^2b^2}{9}
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m Since \(ab = 3\), we can substitute \(a^2b^2 = 3a^2b^2\):
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
