[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \frac{63}{5} = 12 \frac{3}{5}
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 3. **Write the final answer:**
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    The mixed number in its simplest form is:
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \boxed{12 \frac{3}{5}}
