[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m To find the remainder when the product \( 1734 \times 5389 \times 80607 \) is divided by 10, we can follow these steps:
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 1. **Find the remainder of each number when divided by 10:**
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    - For \( 1734 \):
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m      1734 \div 10 = 173 \text{ R } 4 \quad \text{(remainder 4)}
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    - For \( 5389 \):
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m      5389 \div 10 = 538 \text{ R } 9 \quad \text{(remainder 9)}
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    - For \( 80607 \):
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m      \[
