[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 2. **Multiply these remainders together to get the final quotient:**
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    4 \times 9 \times 7
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    Calculate each step:
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    4 \times 9 = 36
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    36 \times 7 = 252
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    So, the quotient is 252.
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 3. **Find the remainder of the product \( 252 \times 7 \):**
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    - For \( 252 \):
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m      252 \div 10 = 25 \text{ R } 2 \quad \text{(remainder 2)}
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    - For \( 7 \):
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m      7 \div 10 = 0 \text{ R } 7 \quad \text{(remainder 7)}
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    Now, multiply these remainders together:
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    2 \times 7 = 14
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \[
