[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 1. **Calculate Tom's mowing rate:**
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    Tom can mow the lawn in 5 hours. Therefore, his mowing rate is:
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \text{Tom's mowing rate} = \frac{1 \text{ lawn}}{5 \text{ hours}} = \frac{1}{5} \text{ lawns per hour}
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 2. **Calculate the fraction of the lawn Tom mows in 2 hours:**
