[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m To solve the problem, we need to find a polynomial \( p(x) \) of the second degree such that:
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 1. \( p(1) = 1 \)
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 2. \( p(2) = 3 \)
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 3. \( p(3) = 2 \)
