[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m First, let's express \( p(x) \) in a general form:
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[ p(x) = ax^2 + bx + c \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m Given:
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[ p(1) = a(1)^2 + b(1) + c = a + b + c = 1 \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[ p(2) = a(2)^2 + b(2) + c = 4a + 2b + c = 3 \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[ p(3) = a(3)^2 + b(3) + c = 9a + 3b + c = 2 \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m We now have a system of linear equations:
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \begin{cases}
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m a + b + c = 1 \\
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 4a + 2b + c = 3 \\
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 9a + 3b + c = 2
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \end{cases}
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m To solve this system, we can use the method of elimination. Subtract the first equation from the third equation:
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[ (9a + 3b + c) - (a + b + c) = 2 - 1 \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[ 8a + 2b = 1 \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[ 4a + b = \frac{1}{2} \quad \text{(Equation 4)} \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m Next, subtract the second equation from the first equation:
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[ (a + b + c) - (4a + 2b + c) = 1 - 3 \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[ -3a - b = -2 \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[ 3a + b = 2 \quad \text{(Equation 5)} \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m Now we have a new system of equations:
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \begin{cases}
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 4a + b = \frac{1}{2} \\
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 3a + b = 2
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \end{cases}
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m Subtract Equation 5 from Equation 4:
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[ (3a + b) - (4a + b) = \frac{1}{2} - 2 \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[ 4a - 3a = \frac{1}{2} - 2 \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[ a = -\frac{3}{2} \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m Substitute \( a = -\frac{3}{2} \) back into Equation 5:
