[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[ b = \frac{4}{2} - \frac{9}{2} \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[ b = -\frac{5}{2} \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m Substitute \( a = -\frac{3}{2} \) and \( b = -\frac{5}{2} \) back into the first original equation:
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[ -\frac{3}{2} + \left(-\frac{5}{2}\right) + c = 1 \]
