[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 2. \( p(2) = a(2)^2 + b(2) + c = 4a + 2b + c = 3 \)
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 3. \( p(3) = a(3)^2 + b(3) + c = 9a + 3b + c = 2 \)
