[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[\sin^3 2x \cos 6x + \cos^3 2x \sin 6x\]can be written in the equivalent form $a \sin bx$ for some positive constants $a$ and $b.$  Find $a + b.$
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
