[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m To solve the given problem, we need to compute the determinant of \(\mathbf{A}^2 - 2\mathbf{A}\) using the given matrix \(\mathbf{A}\).
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m Given:
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \mathbf{A} = \begin{pmatrix} 1 & 3 \\ 2 & 1 \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m First, we compute \(\mathbf{A}^2\):
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \mathbf{A}^2 = \mathbf{A} \cdot \mathbf{A} = \begin{pmatrix} 1 & 3 \\ 2 & 1 \end{pmatrix} \cdot \begin{pmatrix} 1 & 3 \\ 2 & 1 \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \mathbf{A}^2 = \begin{pmatrix} 1 \cdot 1 + 3 \cdot 2 & 1 \cdot 3 + 3 \cdot 1 \\ 2 \cdot 1 + 1 \cdot 2 & 2 \cdot 3 + 1 \cdot 1 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} 1 + 6 & 3 + 3 \\ 2 + 2 & 6 + 1 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} 7 & 6 \\ 4 & 7 \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m Next, we compute \(2\mathbf{A}\):
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 2\mathbf{A} = 2 \begin{pmatrix} 1 & 3 \\ 2 & 1 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} 2 \cdot 1 & 2 \cdot 3 \\ 2 \cdot 2 & 2 \cdot 1 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} 2 & 6 \\ 4 & 2 \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m Now, we compute \(\mathbf{A}^2 - 2\mathbf{A}\):
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \mathbf{A}^2 - 2\mathbf{A} = \begin{pmatrix} 7 & 6 \\ 4 & 7 \end{pmatrix} - \begin{pmatrix} 2 & 6 \\ 4 & 2 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} 7 - 2 & 6 - 6 \\ 4 - 4 & 7 - 2 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} 5 & 0 \\ 0 & 5 \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m Next, we find the determinant of \(\begin{pmatrix} 5 & 0 \\ 0 & 5 \end{pmatrix}\):
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \det \begin{pmatrix} 5 & 0 \\ 0 & 5 \end{pmatrix} = 5 \cdot 5 - 0 \cdot 0 = 25
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m Therefore, the determinant of \(\mathbf{A}^2 - 2\mathbf{A}\) is:
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \boxed{25}
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
