[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m ### Step 2: Find the normal vector to the plane
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m To find the normal vector, we need to take the cross product of the direction vector of the line (which is \(\mathbf{\ell} = \begin{pmatrix} 1 \\ 2 \\ 3 \end{pmatrix}\)) with the vector \(\mathbf{v} = \begin{pmatrix} 1 \\ 2 \\ 3 \end{pmatrix}\):
