[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m We can pair the numerators and denominators to form an arithmetic sequence. The numerators are 1, 2, 3, ... up to 49, and the denominators are 4, 5, 6, ... up to 52, with a common difference of 1.
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m The pairs from the numerators are:
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m $$
