[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m However, the one term \(\frac{50}{53}\) is not paired with a denominator of 53, so we need to add it separately. The element in position 49 of the broken arithmetic sequence is 50 (from the pairs above). The numerator part of this element is \(50/40\):
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
