[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    Next, isolate \( x \) by subtracting 11 from both sides:
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    x = 11 - 11
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    Simplify:
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    x = 0
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m 4. **State the final answer:**
[36m(main_task pid=3102311)[0m    The age of the oldest Wilson child is \(\boxed{0}\).<|endoftext|>
